              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ttiXR",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "tokenLabel(body) 已经存在（≥1000 显示 1.2k），但卡上从来没用过；A / B 右下角的计数可以直接用它。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "eCd9l",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "读取失败时的回退是 \"# 名称 + 描述\"，也就是重复最严重的一种（标题 = 名字、正文 = 描述）。这个回退应该换成 C 的占位板。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "MexMA",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "画布和代码还有一处不一致：MarkdownCover 在有标签时给 pt-10（40px），画布上 Doc 的 padding 还是 16，所以第一行被胶囊盖住了。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OFIab",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "列表视图早就解决了：无媒体的行不画文档，只画一个 36px 的\"文档条\"占位（三条递减的细线，SkillThumb），一个字的正文都不重复。网格是唯一不一致的地方 —— 所以修法是让网格向列表靠，不是再发明一套。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kZDL6",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "行数预算：封面高 - 28（底部统计条）- 40（让开标签胶囊）= 可用高度；等宽 12px、行高 1.5 = 18px/行。132 高放 3 行、148 放 4 行、180 放 6 行。再多就截断，不硬塞。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
