                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "一枚图标 = 一个安装位置。Agent 用它的标记；.agents/skills 这种共享基座用 folder，因为它不属于任何 Agent。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "z0Ojjy",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "技能库本体不占图标位：卡上看到的，都是「除了技能库，它还装到了哪」。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "YpUr5",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "顺序固定：工作区在前、全局在后，同一作用域内按 Agent 的声明次序 —— 同一张卡每次刷新长得一样。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "N0jJh",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "溢出收成一枚 +N，它自己也压住前一格，与页签的规则完全一致。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
