                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "卡 285（这台机器的面板宽）→ 脚 249 → 按钮 94 + 间距 8 → 留给左簇 147。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "azO8s",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "卡 266（最窄）→ 脚 230 → 留给左簇 128。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "t9QzQ",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "这一行的固定开销：图标 13 + 4 段 5px 间距 + 「·」7.2 = 40.2。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "r7VZUj",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "来源词：skill.sh 57.6 / 本地 24。一枚瓦片 20，每多一枚 +13。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "w6YfK",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "今天（文字版「2 个位置」）就已经用掉 146.2 / 147 —— 本来就没有余量。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zP4TZ",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "所以塞进 5 枚的那一刻一定会挤：要么图标压到按钮上，要么来源词让位。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Z7L5P",
              "name": "Col Order",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 14,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "X0Nn7T",
                  "name": "Text",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "挤不下的时候，按这个顺序牺牲",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "N0eBV",
                  "name": "Order Card",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "$canvas",
                  "cornerRadius": "$radius-xl",
                  "stroke": "$hairline",
                  "strokeWidth": 1,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 10,
                  "padding": [
                    18,
                    22
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wKDID",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "① 瓦片永不被裁。一个被切掉一半的 Agent 标记比不显示更糟，所以堆叠是 shrink-0，绝不参与收缩。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "tNxTA",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "② 先牺牲来源的词：省略号 → 完全挤没，图标留着。图标本来就在说「怎么来的」，词只是补充。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "jhMZd",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "③ 来源词让位之后还放不下，才动瓦片：封顶 5 枚，第 6 枚起收成 +N，它自己也占一格。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "fMrwI",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "④ 于是这一行只需要一条 CSS 规则：整行 min-w-0，来源词 truncate + min-w-0，其余全部 shrink-0。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "QTJWD",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "⑤ 今天的问题是这一行「谁都不能缩」—— 容器有 max-w-full，里面的词却没有 min-w-0，所以内容直接画到框外。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "oj4rD",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "⑥ 卡片只回答「装到了几个 Agent」；「装到哪几个」永远是详情弹窗那一列的事，卡片不放全名单。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
